{"id":"mtk-05h-konversi-kecepatan-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-05","subBab":"mtk-05h","slug":"konversi-kecepatan","tier":"campur","title":"OSN/KSN SD — MATEMATIKA","theory":[{"title":"1. Kenapa Harus Konversi Kecepatan?","content":"Bayangkan kamu melihat dua mobil. Mobil A melaju **72 km/jam**, mobil B melaju **15 m/detik**. Siapa yang lebih cepat? Otak kita tidak bisa membandingkan langsung karena satuannya beda. Inilah pentingnya **konversi satuan kecepatan** — menyamakan \"bahasa\" sebelum membandingkan, sebelum memasukkan ke rumus JKW, atau sebelum mengukur waktu tempuh.\n\nSatuan kecepatan yang sering muncul di OSN SD:\n- **km/jam** (kilometer per jam) — paling umum, dipakai mobil, motor, sepeda, kereta\n- **m/detik** (meter per detik) — dipakai pelari, sains, fisika\n- **m/menit** dan **km/menit** — kasus lari atau kendaraan jarak pendek\n- **knot** — kecepatan kapal dan pesawat (1 knot ≈ 1,852 km/jam)\n- **mph** (mile per hour) — kendaraan di negara Inggris/Amerika (1 mph ≈ 1,609 km/jam)"},{"title":"2. Rumus Kunci: km/jam ↔ m/detik","content":"Ini bintang utamanya — 80% soal konversi OSN berkutat di sini.\n\n**Dari km/jam ke m/detik (turun ke satuan lebih kecil-cepat):**\n> 1 km/jam = 1.000 m ÷ 3.600 s = **5/18 m/s ≈ 0,278 m/s**\n\nJadi: km/jam → m/s **kalikan 5/18** atau **bagi 3,6**.\n\n**Dari m/detik ke km/jam (naik ke satuan lebih besar-lambat):**\n> 1 m/s = (3.600/1.000) km/jam = **18/5 km/jam = 3,6 km/jam**\n\nJadi: m/s → km/jam **kalikan 18/5** atau **kalikan 3,6**.\n\n**Trik mengingat arah:**\n- Satuan mengecil (km→m, jam→s) tapi kecepatan tetap sama, jadi **angka km/jam selalu lebih kecil** dibanding angka m/s yang setara. Salah? Cek lagi! Sebenarnya 36 km/jam = 10 m/s — angka km/jam **lebih besar**. Hafalkan satu contoh: **36 km/jam = 10 m/s**. Dari sini kamu tahu arahnya."},{"title":"3. Tabel Konversi Cepat km/jam ↔ m/s","content":"| km/jam | m/detik | km/jam | m/detik |\n|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| 3,6 | 1 | 54 | 15 |\n| 7,2 | 2 | 72 | 20 |\n| 18 | 5 | 90 | 25 |\n| 36 | 10 | 108 | 30 |\n| 45 | 12,5 | 144 | 40 |\n\nHafalkan **36 = 10**, **72 = 20**, **108 = 30** — kelipatan 36 km/jam selalu menghasilkan kelipatan 10 m/s. Sangat sering muncul di soal."},{"title":"4. Konversi Satuan Kecepatan Lain","content":"**m/menit ↔ m/detik:** 1 m/detik = 60 m/menit (kalikan 60 atau bagi 60).\n**km/menit ↔ km/jam:** 1 km/menit = 60 km/jam (kalikan 60).\n**km/menit ↔ m/detik:** 1 km/menit = 1.000 m ÷ 60 s = **16,67 m/detik** (atau 50/3 m/s).\n\n**Knot (mil laut/jam):** 1 knot = 1,852 km/jam ≈ 1,85 km/jam. Pesawat penumpang biasa terbang ~500 knot ≈ 925 km/jam.\n**Mph (mile/jam):** 1 mph = 1,609 km/jam ≈ 1,6 km/jam. Batas kecepatan jalan tol AS sering 65 mph ≈ 105 km/jam."},{"title":"5. Strategi Cepat di Soal","content":"1. **Identifikasi arah konversi** — apa diberikan? apa diminta?\n2. **Tentukan faktor pengali** — pakai trik 36↔10 sebagai jangkar.\n3. **Cek logika** — kecepatan mobil masuk akal 40–120 km/jam atau 11–33 m/s; pelari 10–36 km/jam atau 3–10 m/s; pejalan kaki 4–6 km/jam.\n4. **Jangan tukar arah** — distractor paling umum mengalikan ketika seharusnya membagi.\n5. **Untuk soal cerita JKW**, konversi DULU baru pakai rumus J = K × W, W = J ÷ K, atau K = J ÷ W."},{"title":"6. Anti-Jebakan Klasik","content":"- **Salah arah:** 20 m/s ditulis 20÷3,6 = 5,56 km/jam (salah! Harusnya ×3,6 = 72 km/jam).\n- **Salah faktor:** dikira 1 km/jam = 100 m/s atau 1 km/jam = 60 m/s (campur dengan konversi waktu).\n- **Lupa satuan waktu:** km/menit dikira sama dengan km/jam.\n- **Knot dianggap = km/jam** padahal 1 knot ≈ 1,85 km/jam.\n\nYuk mulai latihan 100 soal!\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 36 km/jam ke m/detik.","options":{"A":"6 m/detik","B":"10 m/detik","C":"12 m/detik","D":"100 m/detik"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 10 m/detik ke km/jam.","options":{"A":"36 km/jam","B":"2,78 km/jam","C":"60 km/jam","D":"100 km/jam"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Sebuah motor melaju 54 km/jam. Berapa m/detik?","options":{"A":"10 m/detik","B":"12 m/detik","C":"15 m/detik","D":"54 m/detik"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 20 m/detik ke km/jam.","options":{"A":"5,56 km/jam","B":"36 km/jam","C":"60 km/jam","D":"72 km/jam"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Berapa m/detik kecepatan 18 km/jam?","options":{"A":"6 m/detik","B":"5 m/detik","C":"3 m/detik","D":"50 m/detik"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 25 m/detik ke km/jam.","options":{"A":"36 km/jam","B":"6,94 km/jam","C":"90 km/jam","D":"250 km/jam"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 72 km/jam ke m/detik.","options":{"A":"25 m/detik","B":"20 m/detik","C":"30 m/detik","D":"7,2 m/detik"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":8,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Sebuah kereta melaju 108 km/jam. Berapa m/detik?","options":{"A":"10,8 m/detik","B":"25 m/detik","C":"36 m/detik","D":"30 m/detik"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":9,"subTopic":"A","level":"Kab","question":"Konversikan 15 m/detik ke km/jam.","options":{"A":"36 km/jam","B":"90 km/jam","C":"54 km/jam","D":"150 km/jam"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","